{"uid":"progs/micropython/variants/minios/lib/mip.py","name":"mip.py","qualname":"progs/micropython/variants/minios/lib/mip.py","kind":"module","file":"progs/micropython/variants/minios/lib/mip.py","line":1,"end_line":414,"language":"py","signature":"","params":[],"returns":"","decorators":[],"bases":[],"modifiers":[],"visibility":"public","doc":{"summary":"mip.py -- MiniOS package installer (frozen module).","description":"Minimal pip for the MiniOS MicroPython port: fetches one .py module over\nHTTP (or HTTPS through the ring-3 TLS engine) and installs it into a\ndirectory on sys.path. Frozen with the port (lib/manifest freeze), so it\nis always importable.\n\nPolicy, fail closed:\n\n- http and https only. Inside MiniOS, https runs `bin/tlsget` (the\n  userspace TLS stack with pinned roots) through SYS_SPAWN and reads the\n  captured response; on host CPython https raises OSError (no minios\n  module), so host tests cover the http and refusal paths.\n- one module per URL and the file name must be a bare identifier plus\n  .py ([A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*), so a hostile server cannot write outside\n  dest (no traversal, subdirectories, percent escapes or dots).\n- the download is written to <dest>/<name>.py.part and renamed on\n  success: a failed fetch never leaves a half module on sys.path.\n- HTTP/1.0 + Connection: close; chunked responses and mismatched\n  Content-Length are refused; MAX_BODY caps the download.\n- a successful install appends dest to sys.path so the module imports\n  in the same session.\n\nUsage inside MiniOS::\n\n    import mip\n    mip.install('http://host:8899/pkg.py')          # into ./lib\n    mip.install('https://host/pkg.py', 'mylib')     # TLS through tlsget\n    micropython -c \"import mip; raise SystemExit(mip.main())\" install <url>","params":[],"returns":null,"yields":null,"raises":[],"attributes":[],"examples":[],"notes":[],"see_also":[],"deprecated":"","since":"","style":"plain"},"parent":"","members":["progs/micropython/variants/minios/lib/mip.py::DEFAULT_DEST","progs/micropython/variants/minios/lib/mip.py::HTTP_PORT_DEFAULT","progs/micropython/variants/minios/lib/mip.py::HTTPS_PORT_DEFAULT","progs/micropython/variants/minios/lib/mip.py::MAX_BODY","progs/micropython/variants/minios/lib/mip.py::MAX_HEAD_BYTES","progs/micropython/variants/minios/lib/mip.py::MAX_REDIRECTS","progs/micropython/variants/minios/lib/mip.py::READ_CHUNK","progs/micropython/variants/minios/lib/mip.py::SOCKET_TIMEOUT_S","progs/micropython/variants/minios/lib/mip.py::REDIRECT_STATUS","progs/micropython/variants/minios/lib/mip.py::TLSGET_PATH","progs/micropython/variants/minios/lib/mip.py::TLSGET_OUT","progs/micropython/variants/minios/lib/mip.py::EEXIST","progs/micropython/variants/minios/lib/mip.py::parse_url","progs/micropython/variants/minios/lib/mip.py::split_url","progs/micropython/variants/minios/lib/mip.py::split_https_url","progs/micropython/variants/minios/lib/mip.py::module_name","progs/micropython/variants/minios/lib/mip.py::parse_response","progs/micropython/variants/minios/lib/mip.py::absolute_url","progs/micropython/variants/minios/lib/mip.py::http_get","progs/micropython/variants/minios/lib/mip.py::ensure_dir","progs/micropython/variants/minios/lib/mip.py::https_get","progs/micropython/variants/minios/lib/mip.py::install","progs/micropython/variants/minios/lib/mip.py::main"],"inferred_raises":[],"returns_value":null,"value":"","base_uids":[],"subclasses":[],"calls":[],"called_by":[]}
